Third-party software
--------------------
OpenLancer uses a fork of Librelancer as a git submodule (external/Librelancer, branch openlancer). The fork adds
OpenLancer's engine changes as commits on top of an upstream commit, so the built programs contain modified
Librelancer code. docs/UPSTREAM.md lists the changes and the reason for each one.
